---
layout: layouts/enterprise.njk
navActive: industries
title: "Cybersecurity Services for Retail & Ecommerce"
description: "Protect customer data and retail systems with cybersecurity services for retail and ecommerce, including penetration testing, vulnerability assessments and application security."
crumbs: [["Home", "/"], ["Industries", "/industries/"], ["Retail & Ecommerce"]]
---
{% from "partials/enterprise/macros.njk" import arrow %}
{% from "partials/enterprise/icons.njk" import icon %}
{%- set faqs = [
  ["What cybersecurity services does CipherTrivia provide for ecommerce businesses?", "CipherTrivia provides ecommerce penetration testing and vulnerability assessments alongside web application security testing and API security testing or cloud security assessments to identify vulnerabilities and protect customer data."],
  ["How much does ecommerce penetration testing cost?", "The cost depends on the number of websites and applications being tested along with platform complexity and the assessment scope. CipherTrivia can provide a quotation based on your security requirements and testing objectives."],
  ["Why does an ecommerce website need penetration testing?", "Penetration testing helps identify exploitable vulnerabilities in login systems and checkout workflows or APIs and administrative interfaces before attackers can use them to compromise customer accounts or business data."],
  ["Can you test the security of our payment gateway and checkout process?", "Yes. CipherTrivia can assess payment integrations and checkout workflows to identify security weaknesses that could expose transaction information or allow unauthorized actions. Testing is conducted within the agreed scope and access permissions."],
  ["Do you provide cybersecurity testing for Shopify, Magento and WooCommerce stores?", "Yes. Security testing can cover ecommerce platforms such as Shopify and Magento or WooCommerce, depending on the agreed scope and the level of access available for assessment."],
  ["How can ecommerce businesses protect customer data from cyberattacks?", "Businesses can strengthen customer data protection through secure authentication and access controls as well as encryption and regular security testing or vulnerability remediation and continuous monitoring."],
  ["Can you assess APIs used for payments and inventory management?", "Yes. CipherTrivia tests ecommerce APIs for broken access controls and authentication weaknesses alongside excessive data exposure and insecure integrations that could affect payment processing or inventory operations."],
  ["Will security testing affect our live ecommerce website?", "Testing can be planned to minimize disruption through agreed testing windows and defined safeguards. Production testing requires additional care around payment processing and customer transactions or other business-critical functions."],
  ["Do you provide a report after completing the security assessment?", "Yes. CipherTrivia provides a report detailing identified vulnerabilities and their severity along with supporting evidence and remediation recommendations to help your technical team prioritize corrective actions."],
  ["Do you retest vulnerabilities after fixes are implemented?", "Yes. We can retest reported vulnerabilities within the agreed scope to verify that corrective actions have resolved the identified issues and to highlight any remaining risks."],
  ["Can CipherTrivia help with PCI DSS security requirements?", "CipherTrivia can assess relevant technical security controls and identify potential gaps related to PCI DSS requirements. This can support remediation efforts but does not replace a formal assessment by a qualified assessor when one is required."],
  ["How long does an ecommerce cybersecurity assessment take?", "The timeline depends on the size of the ecommerce platform and the number of assets being tested as well as the complexity of integrations and the depth of testing. CipherTrivia defines the expected schedule after reviewing the scope."],
  ["Do you provide cybersecurity services for retail mobile applications?", "Yes. We assess Android and iOS shopping applications for insecure data storage and weak authentication or vulnerable API communication and other security issues that could expose customer information."],
  ["How can we get started with CipherTrivia's ecommerce cybersecurity services?", "Contact CipherTrivia with your website or application details and the security concerns you want to address. Our team can review your requirements and recommend an appropriate assessment scope with a proposed timeline and quotation."]
] %}
{#- Challenges: icon + its node position on the attack-surface map (clockwise from top left;
    nine nodes: three along the top, two down each side, two along the bottom under the inner frame) -#}
{%- set challenges = [
  ["card", "12%", "12%", 48, 48, "Payment Fraud and Checkout Attacks", "Attackers exploit weaknesses in payment gateways and checkout workflows to manipulate transactions or steal payment information, creating financial and reputational risks for ecommerce businesses."],
  ["identity", "50%", "12%", 200, 48, "Customer Account Takeovers", "Weak authentication and credential-stuffing attacks can give unauthorized users access to customer accounts and expose personal information or stored payment details."],
  ["app-target", "88%", "12%", 352, 48, "Ecommerce Website Vulnerabilities", "Flaws such as SQL injection and cross-site scripting (XSS) can expose customer databases or compromise website functionality and provide attackers with access to sensitive systems."],
  ["api", "88%", "37.25%", 352, 149, "Insecure APIs and Third-Party Integrations", "Ecommerce platforms depend on APIs and external services for payments and shipping or inventory management. Weak access controls and insecure integrations can expose business data and critical operations."],
  ["database", "88%", "62.75%", 352, 251, "Customer Data Breaches", "Poor access controls and misconfigured databases or cloud storage can expose customer profiles and order histories or other sensitive information."],
  ["agent", "69%", "88%", 276, 352, "Malicious Bots and Automated Attacks", "Automated bots can abuse login pages and scrape product information or exploit promotions and inventory systems, affecting platform performance and business operations."],
  ["shield-crack", "31%", "88%", 124, 352, "Ransomware and Business Disruption", "Ransomware and compromised administrative accounts can interrupt ecommerce operations and restrict access to essential systems, potentially leading to lost sales and recovery costs."],
  ["cloud-alert", "12%", "62.75%", 48, 251, "Cloud and Infrastructure Security Gaps", "Misconfigured cloud environments and outdated software or weak server security can create entry points for attackers targeting ecommerce websites and supporting infrastructure."],
  ["clipboard", "12%", "37.25%", 48, 149, "Compliance and Payment Security Risks", "Ecommerce businesses handling cardholder data must address applicable PCI DSS requirements and relevant data protection obligations to reduce exposure and strengthen security controls."]
] %}
{#- Services: icon, matching service page (empty when there is no dedicated page), title, text -#}
{%- set services = [
  ["target", "/services/penetration-testing/", "Ecommerce Penetration Testing", "We simulate realistic attack scenarios against ecommerce websites and shopping platforms to uncover exploitable vulnerabilities in login systems and checkout workflows or administrative functions before attackers can exploit them."],
  ["magnifier", "/services/vapt-security-services/", "Ecommerce Vulnerability Assessment", "Our assessments identify outdated software and insecure configurations or known security flaws across ecommerce applications and servers, helping teams prioritize vulnerabilities based on severity and potential business impact."],
  ["browser", "/services/web-application-security-testing/", "Web Application Security Testing", "We test ecommerce websites for vulnerabilities such as SQL injection and cross-site scripting (XSS) alongside broken access controls and session management flaws that could compromise customer accounts or business data."],
  ["api", "/services/api-security-testing/", "API Security Testing", "We assess APIs connecting ecommerce platforms with payment gateways and inventory systems or shipping providers to identify authorization weaknesses and excessive data exposure or insecure integrations."],
  ["card", "", "Payment Gateway Security Testing", "We evaluate payment-related application workflows and integrations to identify security gaps that could expose transaction data or allow unauthorized actions during checkout."],
  ["mobile", "/services/mobile-application-security-testing/", "Mobile App Security Testing", "We assess retail shopping applications on Android and iOS for insecure data storage and weak authentication or vulnerable API communication that could put customer information at risk."],
  ["cloud-lock", "/services/cloud-security-services/", "Cloud Security Assessment", "We review cloud-hosted ecommerce environments for misconfigured storage and excessive permissions or exposed services that could compromise customer records and critical business assets."],
  ["network", "/services/network-security-testing/", "Network Security Testing", "We assess retail IT infrastructure and connected systems to identify network exposure and weak access controls or segmentation gaps that could allow attackers to move between systems."],
  ["doc-check", "/services/security-compliance/", "Security Compliance Assessment", "We help ecommerce businesses evaluate relevant security controls against applicable requirements such as PCI DSS and data protection regulations, identifying gaps that need attention."],
  ["retest", "", "Retesting and Remediation Validation", "After vulnerabilities are fixed, we retest affected systems to verify that security issues have been resolved and identify any remaining weaknesses within the agreed scope."]
] %}

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "Service",
      "name": "Cybersecurity Services for Retail & Ecommerce Industries",
      "serviceType": "Cybersecurity Services",
      "description": "Protect customer data and retail systems with cybersecurity services for retail and ecommerce, including penetration testing, vulnerability assessments and application security.",
      "url": "https://www.ciphertrivia.com/industries/ecommerce/",
      "areaServed": "Worldwide",
      "audience": { "@type": "BusinessAudience", "audienceType": "Retail and ecommerce businesses" },
      "provider": { "@id": "https://www.ciphertrivia.com/#organization" },
      "hasOfferCatalog": {
        "@type": "OfferCatalog",
        "name": "Our Cybersecurity Services for Retail and Ecommerce Businesses",
        "itemListElement": [
          {%- for s in services %}
          { "@type": "Offer", "itemOffered": { "@type": "Service", "name": {{ s[2] | dump | safe }} } }{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}
          {%- endfor %}
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "itemListElement": [
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://www.ciphertrivia.com/" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Industries", "item": "https://www.ciphertrivia.com/industries/" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Retail & Ecommerce" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "mainEntity": [
        {%- for q in faqs %}
        { "@type": "Question", "name": {{ q[0] | dump | safe }}, "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": {{ q[1] | dump | safe }} } }{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}
        {%- endfor %}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
</script>

