<!-- OVERVIEW: one passage; its words darken as it is read, the shield   -->
<!-- closes when the reader reaches the end                              -->
<!-- ================================================================== -->
<section class="section section--white" aria-labelledby="s1-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="story" data-lit>
      <h2 class="story__title rv" id="s1-title">Cybersecurity for Retail and Ecommerce Platforms That Protects Every Transaction</h2>

      <div class="story__aside" aria-hidden="true">
        {{ icon("cart", "lg") }}
        <span class="story__rail"></span>
      </div>

      <div class="story__body">
        <p>Every product search and customer login or checkout request creates an interaction that can expose weaknesses in an ecommerce environment. Attackers exploit these gaps to steal payment details and take over customer accounts or manipulate APIs and disrupt online sales. For retailers operating across websites and physical stores, security risks can also extend to point-of-sale (POS) systems and inventory software or third-party integrations.</p>
        <p>CipherTrivia provides cybersecurity services for retail and ecommerce companies that need to identify security flaws before they become costly incidents. We assess ecommerce websites and mobile applications alongside payment workflows and APIs or cloud infrastructure to uncover vulnerabilities involving authentication and authorization or sensitive data exposure and insecure configurations.</p>
        <p>Our approach connects technical testing with business risk so your team can understand what is vulnerable and how an attacker could exploit it. We deliver actionable findings and remediation guidance that help prioritize security fixes and strengthen defenses across digital commerce operations.</p>
        <p>From growing online retailers to large ecommerce platforms, CipherTrivia helps businesses protect customer information and reduce exposure to payment-related threats while maintaining the security and reliability of their digital storefronts.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

