      </li>
      <li class="track__step rv" style="--d:1">
        <span class="track__node" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        {{ icon("radar") }}
        <h3 class="track__title">Security Testing and Vulnerability Identification</h3>
        <p class="track__text">We conduct penetration testing and vulnerability assessments across storefronts and APIs or cloud environments to uncover weaknesses that attackers could exploit.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="track__step rv" style="--d:2">
        <span class="track__node" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        {{ icon("gauge") }}
        <h3 class="track__title">Risk Validation and Impact Analysis</h3>
        <p class="track__text">Our security team validates identified vulnerabilities and evaluates their potential impact on customer accounts and payment workflows or sensitive business information.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="track__step rv" style="--d:3">
        <span class="track__node" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        {{ icon("route") }}
