<section class="section section--stone" aria-labelledby="s5-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="ihead">
      <h2 class="ihead__title rv" id="s5-title">Compliance Frameworks We Help Retail and Ecommerce Businesses Address</h2>
      <p class="ihead__lede rv" style="--d:1">CipherTrivia helps retail brands and ecommerce businesses evaluate security controls against applicable industry standards and data protection requirements. Our cybersecurity assessments identify gaps in payment security and customer data protection while helping teams strengthen technical safeguards across ecommerce platforms and supporting infrastructure.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="fw-grid fw-grid--7">
      <article class="fw rv">
        <div class="fw__top">{{ icon("card") }}<span class="fw__mark" aria-hidden="true">PCI DSS</span></div>
        <h3 class="fw__title">PCI DSS (Payment Card Industry Data Security Standard)</h3>
        <p class="fw__text">We assess payment environments and relevant security controls to identify vulnerabilities affecting cardholder data protection and payment processing systems.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="fw rv" style="--d:1">
        <div class="fw__top">{{ icon("user-shield") }}<span class="fw__mark" aria-hidden="true">GDPR</span></div>
        <h3 class="fw__title">GDPR (General Data Protection Regulation)</h3>
        <p class="fw__text">We review technical safeguards and access controls that protect personal data handled by ecommerce businesses serving customers in the European Economic Area.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="fw rv" style="--d:2">
        <div class="fw__top">{{ icon("badge") }}<span class="fw__mark" aria-hidden="true">ISO 27001</span></div>
        <h3 class="fw__title">ISO/IEC 27001</h3>
        <p class="fw__text">We evaluate information security controls and risk management practices to identify gaps relevant to an organization's Information Security Management System (ISMS).</p>
      </article>
      <article class="fw rv" style="--d:3">
        <div class="fw__top">{{ icon("shield-check") }}<span class="fw__mark" aria-hidden="true">SOC 2</span></div>
        <h3 class="fw__title">SOC 2</h3>
        <p class="fw__text">We assess relevant security controls involving access management and data protection or system security to support organizations preparing for SOC 2 examinations.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="fw rv">
        <div class="fw__top">{{ icon("radar") }}<span class="fw__mark" aria-hidden="true">NIST</span></div>
        <h3 class="fw__title">NIST Cybersecurity Framework</h3>
        <p class="fw__text">We assess cybersecurity practices across asset management and protection as well as threat detection and incident response to identify areas for security improvement.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="fw rv" style="--d:1">
        <div class="fw__top">{{ icon("eye-off") }}<span class="fw__mark" aria-hidden="true">DPDP</span></div>
        <h3 class="fw__title">Digital Personal Data Protection Act (DPDP Act), India</h3>
        <p class="fw__text">We review relevant technical safeguards and personal data protection practices that support compliance efforts under India's applicable digital data protection requirements.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="fw rv" style="--d:2">
        <div class="fw__top">{{ icon("lock") }}<span class="fw__mark" aria-hidden="true">CCPA/CPRA</span></div>
        <h3 class="fw__title">CCPA/CPRA (California Consumer Privacy Laws)</h3>
        <p class="fw__text">We assess relevant security measures and personal information protection practices for ecommerce businesses subject to California's consumer privacy requirements.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

